# Trivy CVE Ignore Policy
# Purpose: Suppress accepted false positives and known low-risk CVEs with documented compensating controls.
# Policy: Every exception MUST include CVE ID, package, justification, and review date.

# CVE-2023-45853: zlib buffer overflow in minizip
# Justification: minizip contrib library is not linked or invoked in Python runtime execution path.
# Compensating Control: Distroless non-root runtime prevents shell execution.
# Review Date: 2026-12-31
CVE-2023-45853

# CVE-2024-24790: Go net/netip unexpected behavior with IPv4-mapped IPv6
# Justification: Upstream base image patch pending; ingress gateway enforces IPv4 canonicalization.
# Review Date: 2026-12-31
CVE-2024-24790
